	(text "DOWNLOAD: hold BOOT (GPIO28 low), pulse RESET; GPIO27 stays high.\n3.3V logic UART only; header pin6 is a voltage reference, not a power input.\nUSB D+ startup transitions may appear on TX data: RP stays input and ignores\ndata until C5 configures PARLIO and asserts VALID. Pre-arm all RX transactions.\nSeries resistors belong at the listed source, regardless of schematic page."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 251.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
